sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin
  participant L as Log Hub
  participant S as SMTP relay
  participant T as Teammate
  A->>L: create user (email, role, team)
  L->>L: check ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS, create account without a password
  L->>S: set-password email
  S-->>T: link = PUBLIC_BASE_URL/… (24 h, once)
  T->>L: open the link, set password
  L-->>T: password set
  T->>L: sign in
